              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 24.12-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Int 36.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore pee eidip Nebukadresa olaiguanani le Babilon ataarai aitung'uaa Yerusalem Yekonia olayioni le Yehoiakin, olaiguanani le Yuda, tenebo ilkituaak le Yuda, o lelo arriyiak o lkunono, neyau ninche Babilon, naaitodol nanu Olaitoriani ena duaata: ng'ura nkikapuni are naabore ilng'abolo eirragieki te dukuya enkaji o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore enkikapu nabo neeta ilng'abolo sidain oleng, laa ninche ooitera aaku, kake ore enkae kikapu neeta ilng'abolo torrok oleng lemeinosayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naajoki nanu Olaitoriani, “Kainyoo iyie idolita, Yeremia?” Najo nanu ilng'abolo, “Ilng'abolo, sidain sidain oleng, o lng'abalo torrok torrok oleng, torrok, oleng lemeinosayu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ororei lo Laitoriani alotu enatii nanu ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nji ejo Olaitoriani, Enkai e Israel: Anaa enatiu kulo ng'abolo sidain neijia adol aa sidain lelo yararot ooing'uaa Yuda, apa lairriwayie nanu meshomo aaing'uaa ene wueji aapuo enkop oo Lkaldayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kapik nanu nkonyek aainei shumata ninche te sidai, naa kayau nanu ninche arrinyu meetu ena kop. Kashetu nanu ninche, nemadung'udung'oki ninche enkop; kaun nanu ninche, nemadotu ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaisho nanu ninche oltau oyiolounye ninche nchere ara nanu Olaitoriani; naa keaku ninche iltung'ana laainei naaku nanu Enkai enye, amu kaashukokino ninche nanu to ltau lenye pooki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kake nji ejo Olaitoriani: Ore anaa lelo ng'abolo torrok oleng lemeinosayu neijia nanu aiko Sedekia olaiguanani le le Yuda, o ilkituaak lenyena, ilo pisiai le Yerusalem otelekua tiatua ena kop, o lelo ootonita tiatua enkop e Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaitaa nanu ninche olkirutoto too nkitoriat pooki e nkop neaku enkurruna, enaileti o enkitakuenisho, o oldeket tiatua iwuejitin pooki nareu nanu ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa kairriwaa nanu olalem, o lameyu o lmeitai shumata ninche, o metaba anaa neidaikieki tukul teina kop apa naishoo nanu ninche o loo menye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.24.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
